  notes: TOGO M3181 narrative paragraph4 and Trace vitamins table paragraph12 agree on all three vitamins
    per litre; the table explicitly lists1L distilled water. Current captured formulation is proposed
    without assuming an unlocated original paper or historical lot invariant. Thiamine salt/hydrate and
    biotin stereochemistry are not specified, so child identities stay UNMAPPED and closure is UNKNOWN.
    The receiving RM medium uses1ml. The source discrepancy involving sodium molybdate belongs to its
    separate trace-metal stock and is not imported into this vitamin preparation.
